# Licensing

No overall licence has been chosen for this repository yet. Before publishing it
widely, pick one — the pieces have different constraints:

- `patches/*.patch` are diffs against Wine, which is LGPL-2.1-or-later. Anything
  derived from Wine source has to stay under that licence.
- The release bundle contains a compiled Wine, so distributing it carries Wine's
  LGPL obligations: the corresponding source must be available. `patches/README.md`
  plus the exact upstream tag (`wine-11.17`) and the configure line in README.md
  are what satisfy that; keep them accurate.
- `tools/x87sidecar/` is a third-party binary, from
  https://github.com/Sonic-The-Hedgehog-LNK1123/rosetta-x87 — check its licence
  before redistributing it.
- The scripts here (`bfme`, `install.sh`, `bfme-config.sh`, `dist/`, `tools/`) are
  original work and can be licensed however you like.

Nothing in this repository contains or redistributes EA's game. The All in One
Launcher is downloaded from bfmeladder.com at install time, not bundled.
